            <rule name="Dirty, Rotten, Sneaky" id="5ec6-e2a2-e078-765e" hidden="false">
              <description>After each round of combat is fought, the Sneaky Gits may Fight in an Extra Rank each turn for as long as they are in combat. So, after one turn, they fight in one additional rank, after two turns they fight in two additional ranks, and so on.</description>
