              <rules>
                <rule name="Dark Renown" id="a32f-3c42-c15a-f9ca" hidden="false">
                  <description>All friendly models with the Contempt special rule within 12&quot; add +1 to their combat resolution result.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="The Ironsworn" id="019c-e22b-1db3-7053" hidden="false">
                  <description>If Drazhoath the Ashen is included in your army, you may upgrade one unit of Infernal Guard to the Ironsworn for a cost of +2 points per model. This unit has Weapon Skill 5, as well as the Mighty Blow (1) and Magical Attacks special rules. The unit must be equipped with hand weapons and shields.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Master of the Legion of Azgorh" id="b446-830a-50d6-d73b" hidden="false">
                  <description>If Drazhoath the Ashen is your Army General, units of Infernal Guard (but not Ironsworn) may be taken as Core Units instead of Special Units.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
