                            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="08ca-4a32-203d-40c0">This item gives the wearer a 5+ Ward save. In addition, for every failed Ward save the wielder suffers in close combat, a Strength 2 hit is automatically inflicted on the model that caused the Wound.</characteristic>
