                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">At the start of your Magic phase, you can target one enemy unit within 8&quot; of this model and roll a D6. On a 1 or 2 nothing happens. On a 3-5 that enemy unit suffers D3 wounds which Ignores Armour saves. On a 6, that enemy unit suffers D6 wounds which Ignores Armour saves.</characteristic>
