                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">The wearer gains +1 Strength. If the wearer rolls a 1 to hit, this blow strikes a random friendly model in base contact instead. If there are no friendly models in base contact, the Hit is resolved against the character itself.</characteristic>
