              <profiles>
                <profile name="Possessed Amulet" id="4379-354e-d251-e832" hidden="false" typeId="ff67-d27f-2eef-bb35" typeName="Enchanted Item">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">In Close Combat, the bearer Wounds on a 2+ regardless of the target&apos;s Toughness. However, if a &apos;1&apos; is rolled on the To Wound dice, a further wound is inflicted on the bearer instead which Ignores Armour Saves.</characteristic>
