                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">One use only. A Wizard may use this scroll when attempting to cast a spell. If they do so, they may add +1 Power Dice to every casting roll they attempt this Magic Phase.</characteristic>
