                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">One use only. This item can be used at the start of any of your Magic phases. Once used, one friendly unit within 12&quot; gains +1 Toughness for until the start of your next Magic phase.</characteristic>
