              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="20"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Blood of Hashut" id="bda2-6a90-faa1-3832" hidden="false" typeId="24d7-7f7d-a4d7-c26c" typeName="Arcane Item">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">One use only. The Blood of Hashut can be used in close combat instead of attacking normally that turn. It targets a single model in base contact. Roll a D6; on a 2+, D6 automatic hits are inflicted on the target. The To Wound score of these hits is always equal to the unmodified close combat armour save of the target (excluding Natural Armour). For example, a model with a 3+ save is wounded on a 3+ and so on. Attacks  from the Blood of Hashut have the Flaming Attacks, Ignores Armour Saves and Magical Attacks special rules.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
